{"reviewId": "410212399_8bzWsnNja", "review": {"abstract": "(1)每个康波是指一个相当长时期总的价格的上升或总的价格的下降。(2)价格的长期波动不是自己产生的，而康德拉季耶夫认为是资本主义体系本质的结果。(3)每个康波又嵌套着几个库兹涅茨周期和几个朱格拉周期。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "对滴，房地产不是没落了，是进入了萧条期。未来还要大规模维护翻新建筑，土木就又回春啦", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 0, "range": "3423-3523", "createTime": 1787500168, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "410212399_8bzWsnNja", "userVid": 410212399, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 410212399, "name": "江楼橘柚", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0023-g6wyBl6ylebEd28GLCOcgfb/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "江楼橘柚", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M1-0-500", "desc": "连续阅读", "title": "连续阅读", "levelIndex": 500}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 2, "likes": [{"userVid": 930524413, "name": "淇小鱼", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/3icianYibHBrXNEol5uvxMxZ9dYpsNiavse2xnM1h6cxhWpCiaeIJyIDcJcdnMAKjntdDyaavQLwV6lo/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": ""}], "commentsCount": 4, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "但我想提问，长期看中国的房子真的还有繁荣期吗？人口数量的减少，房子需求应该是下降的，供需关系来看供大于求？但也有可能是，过去的房子都是集中型小房间，后续修建更优质的大占地的房子来卖？通过提高质量来提升购买意愿也不是不可能\n", "reviewId": "410